%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 24cee7e49fc532a45ab71bd5ace6cb7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: S2pre
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: It's hot.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB365\uB124\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Yeah... Feels like it gets even hotter as the sun goes down.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB7EC\uAC8C... \uD574\uAC00 \uC838 \uAC08 \uB54C\uAC00
      \uB354 \uB354\uC6B4 \uAC83 \uAC19\uC544."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Why do the people who wake wells have to be thirstier than everyone
      else?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBB3C \uB6AB\uB294 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uC65C \uB354 \uBAA9\uB9C8\uB974\uAC8C
      \uB2E4\uB140\uC57C \uD558\uC8E0?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: No idea. Too hot to think about complicated things.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBAB0\uB77C. \uB354\uC6B0\uB2C8\uAE4C \uBCF5\uC7A1\uD55C \uAC74
      \uC0DD\uAC01\uD558\uAE30 \uC2EB\uC5B4."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: That's so unfair... Now I don't even feel like working.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uCC38 \uBD88\uACF5\uD3C9\uD558\uB124\uC694... \uAC11\uC790\uAE30
      \uC758\uC695\uB3C4 \uC548 \uB098\uACE0."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Want to hear a joke so bad it'll give you chills?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC370\uB801\uD55C \uC598\uAE30\uB97C \uC880 \uD574\uC8FC\uBA74
      \uC2DC\uC6D0\uD574\uC9C8\uAE4C?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: I'm already getting annoyed, so don't.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC9DC\uC99D\uB098\uB824\uACE0 \uD558\uB2C8\uAE4C \uADF8\uB9CC\uB46C\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: All right. How about this, then?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC88B\uC544, \uADF8\uB7FC \uC774\uAC74 \uC5B4\uB54C?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Wake the next well and I'll give you a present.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB2E4\uC74C \uC6B0\uBB3C\uB9CC \uB6AB\uC73C\uBA74 \uC120\uBB3C\uC744
      \uD558\uB098 \uC904\uAC8C."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: No thanks. Not interested.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB410\uAC70\uB4E0\uC694. \uBCC4\uB85C \uAD00\uC2EC \uC5C6\uC5B4\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: ...What is it, though?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "...\uADFC\uB370 \uBB54\uB370\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Hmm... Honestly, I'm not really sure myself.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC74C... \uC0AC\uC2E4 \uB098\uB3C4 \uC798 \uBAA8\uB974\uACA0\uC5B4."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: That's not how presents work.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB7F0 \uAC8C \uC5B4\uB528\uC5B4\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Don't tell me it's just a day off or something.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC124\uB9C8 \uADF8\uB0E5 \uD558\uB8E8 \uC26C\uAC8C \uD574\uC8FC\uACA0\uB2E4,
      \uBB50 \uC774\uB7F0 \uAC70\uC608\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: That's not it.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uAC74 \uC544\uB2C8\uC9C0."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Then it's not going to be something like our friendship or the
      satisfaction of a job well done, right?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uBB50 \uC6B0\uB9AC\uB4E4\uC758 \uC6B0\uC815\uC774\uB098
      \uB178\uB825\uC758 \uBFCC\uB4EF\uD568 \uAC19\uC740 \uAC74 \uC544\uB2C8\uACA0\uC8E0?"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Well... when you put it that way, you're not far off...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBB50 \uB530\uC9C0\uACE0 \uBCF4\uBA74 \uBE44\uC2B7\uD558\uAE34
      \uD55C\uB370..."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: W-Wait! Wait up for meee...!
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC7A0... \uC7A0\uAE50\uB9CC, \uAC19\uC774 \uAC00\uC544\uC544...!"
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
